OL,3,GNEWSASeven people charged in connection
OL,4,Awith pro-Palestine Action rally
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have now been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with a pro-Palestine Action
OL,8,Frally in Edinburgh.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to a demonstration
OL,11,Foutside the US Consulate building on
OL,12,FRegent Terrace on 31 October.
OL,14,FTwo men and a woman were charged with
OL,15,Fterrorism offences relating to
OL,16,F"supporting a proscribed organisation"
OL,17,Fon Tuesday.
OL,19,FThree other women and a man were
OL,20,Fpreviously charged in connection with
OL,21,Fthe same offence relating to the
OL,22,Fprotest.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
